# ===== 五、可选：订阅现成的超大规则集（默认关闭，内存吃紧 / iOS16 以下慎用）=====
# blackmatrix7 的 Advertising 列表有几十万条域名，拦截最彻底，但会明显增加内存占用。
#RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Shadowrocket/Advertising/Advertising.list,REJECT
#RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/app2smile/rules/master/rule/zhihu-ad.list,REJECT
#RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/app2smile/rules/master/rule/tieba-ad.list,REJECT
